# ---------- RESPONSE HEADERS ----------
#
# Two jobs in one file.
#
# 1. REAL SECURITY AND PRIVACY. The Referrer-Policy line is the one that
#    matters most here: without it, every site a member clicks through to
#    learns they came from a mental health community. That is exactly the
#    kind of leak the consumer health data laws exist to stop.
#
# 2. ARG. Anyone opening the Network tab or running curl gets a little
#    something. See docs/SECRETS.md for the full map.
#
# Cloudflare reads this file on deploy. Syntax is two spaces of indent per
# header under each path pattern.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Redacted: [REDACTED]
  X-Powered-By: caffeine, spite, and one backend class starting in December
  X-Build: 0.1.0
  X-Tests: zero
  X-Note: you are reading response headers. that is a choice. respect.
  X-See-Also: /archive, /humans.txt, /.well-known/security.txt

/archive
  X-Recovered: 2 of 5
  X-Unrecoverable: idkreally.com, sadsquad.org, iiclout.com
  X-Note: the fourth one is still in its redemption window. for now.

/welcome
  X-Note: this page has no secrets in it on purpose.

/api/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Cache-Control: no-store
